Begin3
Title:          ListVESA
Description:    ListVESA is a utility to report which VESA video modes are supported by the system's hardware. You can use command line options to tailor information listed to one specific mode, modes supporting a specific color bit depth, modes supporting linear frame buffer, or simply general information on the video adapter itself or a table summarizing available modes with no detailed screen data.
Keywords:       list, mode, VESA, video
End
